  <h1 class="display-md reveal" style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Privacy policy</h1>

  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">This privacy policy explains the nature, scope and purpose of the processing of personal data on this website under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR). This translation is provided for convenience; the <a href="/datenschutz/" hreflang="de" style="color:var(--accent);">German version</a> is legally binding.</p>

