  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.5rem;">Contact by email</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">If you contact us by email, the information you provide (sender address, content of the message) is stored for the purpose of handling your enquiry. The legal basis is Art. 6 (1) (b) or (f) GDPR (pre-contractual measures or legitimate interest in responding).</p>

  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.5rem;">Hosting</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">This website is hosted by netcup GmbH, Daimlerstraße 25, 76185 Karlsruhe, Germany. Personal data collected on this website is processed on netcup's servers in Germany. A data processing agreement under Art. 28 GDPR is in place with netcup.</p>
  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.5rem;">Server log files</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">When you visit this website, the server automatically stores information transmitted by your browser: IP address, date and time of access, page requested, amount of data transferred, referrer URL, browser type and operating system. This data is not combined with other data sources. Processing serves the technical provision and security of the website (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). Log files are deleted as soon as they are no longer required for these purposes.</p>

  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.5rem;">Google Search Console</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">We use Google Search Console, a free service of Google Ireland Limited, to analyse this website's visibility in Google Search. Search Console <strong>runs no script on this website and sets no cookies in visitors' browsers</strong>. The data visible there (search queries, clicks, impressions, position) comes exclusively from Google's own search logs and from Googlebot's crawling — not from any collection on this website itself. The one-time verification of ownership is done technically via a DNS record, a verification file or a meta tag and does not itself constitute processing of website visitors' personal data.</p>

  <h2 class="display-md reveal" style="margin:2rem 0 1rem;font-size:1.5rem;">Your rights</h2>
  <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.8;font-size:.9375rem;color:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.7);">You have the right to access, rectification, erasure and restriction of processing of your personal data, as well as the right to lodge a complaint with the competent supervisory authority. Please contact us at the address given above.</p>

